{"title":"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/c/58c55a35bf4c6ac173e1545adc8a6766e494a92e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{8}+\\sqrt{18}=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"98\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/f/aef5c444783d6bda9508ab5bc9016312e5a99fab.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{(A)}\\ \\sqrt{20}\\qquad\\text{(B)}\\ 2(\\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{3})\\qquad\\text{(C)}\\ 7\\qquad\\text{(D)}\\ 5\\sqrt{2}\\qquad\\text{(E)}\\ 2\\sqrt{13}\\]\" width=\"496\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/a/95a806d00859f638e71590aef0b355a03b8f446a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{8} = 2  \\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/e/4defc6ba6ce4d2365f019f45e81620a206a3fb00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{18} = 3  \\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"91\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>So adding the two terms we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/f/96f236a179e0c98ba06b1c8fca772cf00a4b2ef7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2  \\sqrt{2} + 3  \\sqrt{2} = 5  \\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"147\" height=\"18\" /> , which corresponds to answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693c4044f8526a8179956e8ac7a3f2f9d61e2c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" /> .\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME\" title=\"1988 AHSME\">1988 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1988 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1988\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Probl